{
 "duration": 176.85891666666666,
 "units": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": "Intro",
   "text": "I woke up in the dark, and something was breathing right over my bed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.493
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I looked up, and two black holes stared back at me.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 5.793,
   "end": 9.607
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A blue mask.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 9.907,
   "end": 10.864
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A black hoodie.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 11.164,
   "end": 12.065
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "No nose, no mouth.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 12.365,
   "end": 13.932
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And black liquid dripping from its empty eyes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 14.232,
   "end": 17.415
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And this was not the first time it had come for me.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 17.865,
   "end": 21.456
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "So what did it want?",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 21.756,
   "end": 23.065
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Let us go back to the beginning.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 23.365,
   "end": 25.129
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "My name is Mitch.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 25.579,
   "end": 26.877
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "After the bank took our house, I moved in with my brother, Edwin.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 27.177,
   "end": 32.133
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "We had not seen each other for ten years, and for one week, everything was normal.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 32.433,
   "end": 38.376
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then, one night at one in the morning, I heard rustling outside.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 38.826,
   "end": 43.985
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I thought it was a raccoon, and Edwin agreed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 44.285,
   "end": 47.734
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The next night, I heard my window open, and a loud thump, as if something had climbed inside.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 48.184,
   "end": 56.285
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I sat up and looked around.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 56.585,
   "end": 58.509
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "There was nothing there.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 58.809,
   "end": 60.008
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "In the morning, Edwin dropped his coffee cup the moment he saw me.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 60.458,
   "end": 65.638
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He held up a mirror, and I saw a deep cut across my cheek.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 65.938,
   "end": 70.612
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "At the hospital, the doctor said I must have been sleepwalking.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 71.062,
   "end": 75.3
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then he showed me a neat, stitched line on my side.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 75.6,
   "end": 79.067
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I had lost my left kidney, and nobody knew how.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 79.367,
   "end": 83.14
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The next night was my breaking point.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 83.59,
   "end": 86.212
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Around midnight, I woke up, and I froze.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 86.512,
   "end": 89.753
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A creature was staring down at me, face to face.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 90.053,
   "end": 93.653
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It had a black hoodie, a dark blue mask, and no eyes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 94.103,
   "end": 98.558
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "There were only empty black sockets, dripping.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 98.858,
   "end": 102.226
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I grabbed my camera and took a picture.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 102.676,
   "end": 105.415
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It lunged at me, reaching for my chest with its claws.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 105.715,
   "end": 110.068
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I kicked it in the face, grabbed my wallet, and ran out into the night.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 110.368,
   "end": 115.929
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I ran into the woods near the house, I tripped on a rock, and everything went black.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 116.379,
   "end": 122.821
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I woke up in the hospital.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 123.271,
   "end": 125.007
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The doctor said my injuries were small, and my parents were coming.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 125.307,
   "end": 130.144
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then he told me that my brother had been killed by something.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 130.444,
   "end": 134.463
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "My parents drove me back to the house to collect my things.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 134.913,
   "end": 138.991
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "In the hallway, I saw my brother, and I could not look for long.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 139.291,
   "end": 144.182
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Next to him lay something small.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 144.482,
   "end": 146.815
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "beat": 13,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I picked it up, and I walked to my parents' car without a word.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 147.265,
   "end": 152.061
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "beat": 13,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "When I looked at what I was holding, I nearly threw up.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 152.361,
   "end": 156.036
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "beat": 13,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was the part of me that the creature had stolen, black with that same dark liquid.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 156.336,
   "end": 163.005
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "This story is inspired by the Eyeless Jack creepypasta, first posted by Azelf5000.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 163.455,
   "end": 172.074
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "beat": 15,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Would you have stayed in that house a second night?",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 172.524,
   "end": 175.659
  }
 ]
}